在适用法律允许的范围内，维护者不就归档材料的准确性、完整性或
特定用途适用性作出保证。识别错误、遗漏、时间异常和未审核状态
应按记录中的质量标记核实。

To the extent permitted by applicable law, maintainers make no warranty
as to the accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose
of archived content. Consult the quality flags for recognition errors,
omissions, timestamp issues, and review status.

